comment0.text=\r\n\ Mobile\ class\ represents\ a\ mobile\ phone\ gadget.\r\n\ It\ extends\ Gadget\ and\ adds\ calling\ credit\ functionality.\r\n\r\n\ CS4001\ Coursework\ -\ Gadget\ Shop\r\n
