comment3.text=\r\n\ Adds\ credit\ to\ the\ mobile\ phone.\r\n\ If\ amount\ is\ not\ positive,\ displays\ an\ error\ message.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ amount\ the\ number\ of\ minutes\ to\ add\r\n
