comment4.text=\r\n\ Makes\ a\ call\ to\ the\ given\ number\ for\ the\ given\ duration.\r\n\ Deducts\ duration\ from\ credit\ if\ sufficient,\ otherwise\ prints\ error.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ phoneNumber\ the\ number\ to\ call\r\n\ @param\ duration\ \ \ \ the\ duration\ in\ minutes\r\n
